#> @participant1 @participant5 I have done some more testing today using my fork of @participant1 's repro app.
> 
> I think I now know what the cause of all these problems is: the use of the Updates API early in app startup, to check for and fetch updates, is happening simultaneously with the same operations happening in native code. This is because your apps are configured to check for updates and download them automatically at startup.
> 
> I'd like you to add the following to the "updates" section of your `app.json`/`app.config.js`, to disable the automatic check:
> 
> ```json
> "updates": {
>   "checkAutomatically": "ON_ERROR_RECOVERY",
>   ...
> }
> ```
> 
> Then, do another `eas build` to generate a new native build of your app.
> 
> If I'm right, the crashes and hangs should no longer occur when checking for updates.

